    "en": {
      "trackName": "Candy Galaxy Watch Game",
      "description": "Candy Galaxy Watch Game is a cosmic Match-3 puzzle built for quick play on your wrist!\n\nSwap galactic candies, clear space obstacles, and solve colorful puzzle levels on the go.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n\nMatch 3 Candies: Swap adjacent candies to line up 3 of the same cosmic treats to clear them.\nMake Combos: Match 4 or 5 candies to trigger special galaxy bombs and space clearing magic.\nBeat Levels: Clear target candies and space tiles before running out of moves.\nUse Boosters: Use power-ups to blast through tough spots and hard lines.\nFEATURES:\n\nFast and fun Match-3 gameplay built for your wrist.\nVibrant space candy graphics and smooth animations.\nHundreds of cosmic puzzle stages.\nPerfect for quick casual breaks offline.\nDownload Candy Galaxy Watch Game today and start matching candies in space on your wrist!",
